      "historicalContext": "Modeled on the Supabase dashboard's visual identity — the open-source Firebase alternative whose green-on-charcoal look became a reference point for developer-tool design. Packaged as a tweakcn preset.",
      "colorPalette": "Neutral shells, green signal. Light mode is near-white `#fcfcfc` with near-black ink `#171717` and a mint primary `#72e3ad`; dark mode flips to charcoal (`#121212` / `#171717`) where the primary deepens to Supabase green `#006239`. Destructive runs rust `#ca3214` light and oxblood `#541c15` dark. Charts break the monochrome — green, blue, violet, amber, emerald.",
